  "bundle_request_count": 16,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:05dea1a7e1e5378549bf4660f1dc6bf1f868f94d4435c96a4cb97aab135488e9",
      "request_id": "05dea1a7e1e5378549bf4660f1dc6bf1f868f94d4435c96a4cb97aab135488e9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fbace88cb892140a93db0676a4f45842",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "真正的突破，发生在巴黎。法网决赛对科博利，前四盘打成二比二。这一次，第五盘的六比一属于兹维列夫。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b0f5946202c4bcbffcced300238c9b6b6ed13af01b2da7a736f98a6b6d7dabc7",
      "words_sha256": "20469788b70b490c4ced42acb5268654d117ce0d4fd848d9d0818ba50d962ba0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:26fc8d390045397063d061c13160bff08cfde15c152f176a64dc4ff4babca553",
      "request_id": "26fc8d390045397063d061c13160bff08cfde15c152f176a64dc4ff4babca553",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "48cf6319396009b576c17daaaee80f19",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六月之前，单打还没有冠军，九月已经握住两座大满贯。他今年的两座单打冠军，都来自大满贯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d7c92cd6f64c4c52d1402ac868ad3e42d23c1e4a3ab5a17f9dc544a611279fa0",
      "words_sha256": "c07456448388448fd2da12ef93f7a38f108d99d3119f080a74f7684d9c09622c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:50a85cbd17ecfdef9136acd21349e21c50f2dbd0c86d7662080930d8ee3b3d4b",
      "request_id": "50a85cbd17ecfdef9136acd21349e21c50f2dbd0c86d7662080930d8ee3b3d4b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e5df2ea23849564334e0b1678547336b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "维也纳止步4强之后，他来到巴黎，却以六比七、二比六输给穆塞蒂。世界第一的首战失利，下一站，是十一月十五日开始的都灵总决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "132ed2fa2baffe71055d6d08459696a8c955c509d31a03bcedf4a177ad2dccd4",
      "words_sha256": "1bf0dd6df91c31c6fccbd503f1250aa9da4109e5f1eb6e39f1de81c154313242"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:616d9e6d7eb9646cd3176f0abb2aad1f4eb798549f737747684d56fc16b0282d",
      "request_id": "616d9e6d7eb9646cd3176f0abb2aad1f4eb798549f737747684d56fc16b0282d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a605e01c31aed433d1ca74d389e8cbe8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "印第安维尔斯、迈阿密、蒙特卡洛，连续三站大师赛，都打进4强，也连续三次输给辛纳。慕尼黑又止步4强。他还没有拿到单打冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2b2abbf54211c2284ad02f11a0249f2b4b4358718a51451e4099a6601aa82ee1",
      "words_sha256": "9f333fdce4d6667af48ba668682fc511e32aa39a8f4b7981a843e184dd26b190"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:86e39c3d0a12d3fdec4b0a01a223bf052140c9607500b586589032a2cd8c748d",
      "request_id": "86e39c3d0a12d3fdec4b0a01a223bf052140c9607500b586589032a2cd8c748d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6a8a2a45508a60453fdf15605a7e6f05",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五月的马德里，他终于闯进本赛季第一场单打决赛，等在对面的还是辛纳。一比六、二比六，又一次失利。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "11a7cebea2b338070e91456f4b0aa4e15d9c051e15d30f0dde615cdd7c7bc9f0",
      "words_sha256": "ea6ccdb150ba21c4e21f03503bc6aa6f46553a87d210d90379826c49b874eb1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8ad877f99d688bc4085d5fec719d65432fa7f06a6dc0d9bea5efc8a57e647a5a",
      "request_id": "8ad877f99d688bc4085d5fec719d65432fa7f06a6dc0d9bea5efc8a57e647a5a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8b1dbd99d2a11e6b3367f34c193e3b08",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十一月，兹维列夫第一次站上世界第一，却在巴黎输掉了登顶后的第一场球。他带去都灵的，是怎样一个赛季？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6a8a6f002f0d3ec80ec93844b3027e8a42588424e01c6bdbfb71461eb58e4257",
      "words_sha256": "2082fcee6e8e82d227a2e2e08c1dc1121955ea81d5fb18ec20efc356f0acd913"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9135033e187acea36aa3a5f58b393f47325e92cfc568cee0e4d7b7918366e0d8",
      "request_id": "9135033e187acea36aa3a5f58b393f47325e92cfc568cee0e4d7b7918366e0d8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c50ddeb1a065f2c958f93e3d41062cae",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月十二日，他提前锁定年终第一。但冠军之后，也会疲惫。他自己说，美网后总共只休息了一天。上海半决赛先赢一盘，还是被福基纳逆转。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9054a1f72b809aa659983fb4842e5d679557b5aa674dc5110f2055ee68b13e60",
      "words_sha256": "06ab4eab222042419d61cf899d1d2e9cb77ef8977c0508a47433a6ef5e12a1f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9611e385c08273711225eef4d914ffaf5b906d9252b5372dd4902305b5a93b87",
      "request_id": "9611e385c08273711225eef4d914ffaf5b906d9252b5372dd4902305b5a93b87",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3f3ae05a3be18b8def7e57d931fb6922",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "就在加拿大首战出局之后，八月六日，ATP正式宣布他入围年终总决赛。都灵门票到手，他的赛季还没有到最高点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8ab5e154263d3bd6efa5a6621d3b3f6017eeea674095e2b1f41ef4a076f8c6c1",
      "words_sha256": "269c5e7d11f9ca4aa34d2170745a1b5cb02d7c456f143188053d7c800766fdc6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a3124eae60ca17ca7ca1c8474ef169c9dff3f79015006d232ff1fc6f931ea490",
      "request_id": "a3124eae60ca17ca7ca1c8474ef169c9dff3f79015006d232ff1fc6f931ea490",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2d6879a2c943ef2594364689eaa862b1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "兹维列夫年终路，2座大满贯后登顶。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8275849c575254a44195411df02957a99d1225bda9d2a1f19a367c1bb53844ee",
      "words_sha256": "9f7490bed83e7e7b77ec2198f84697771602bd544d313c0a0cb3c352bbd953c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5e79e5655e47efc2c0d3cee79eaeb80b9ff840b05900c74b39a6b72a62d8d70e",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bf480a44507a785473a51c15cf490638ced9c967b3f01cd6e65ba0a5f7d5b2c6",
      "request_id": "bf480a44507a785473a51c15cf490638ced9c967b3f01cd6e65ba0a5f7d5b2c6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bb01b60f9972c1ba63d4935f78c385ec",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网，他又一次打进决赛。先赢一盘，辛纳却拿走了后面三盘。巴黎突破之后，草地上的这道关，他还是没能跨过去。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "734c1da3dd4fea05588b80f326e210448f408e2520566d2c7a5a2a30d54d0aa8",
      "words_sha256": "12c919314216d90916640ea7baaa0d279e3a6ff18a2d7b6153147cc192d41584"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e266ebe2142fc4f7683b6ea3a6d65dfba9e7688b5f13753af6aa5fa0d67cadc9",
      "request_id": "e266ebe2142fc4f7683b6ea3a6d65dfba9e7688b5f13753af6aa5fa0d67cadc9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0c85c50f93003ab95a77f7c751bb4cb8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "纽约，他连续第三项大满贯闯进决赛。面对谢尔顿，先拿两盘，再被追回一盘，最后以六比二收下第四盘。比赛结束，他竟然没发现自己已经赢了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "674bd90e6b7255bbc1dd855bd7551f4ebaf10416b6ecaae4a71fde5411403bd1",
      "words_sha256": "ff5174936341d48d7f52c03b86cc905541dff8b837a3cc0c29b703a3d6447d52"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e378e3afad6ce11ab8b79b598b215128a1b5d8e19bab7d842a2ae6bb398f14ec",
      "request_id": "e378e3afad6ce11ab8b79b598b215128a1b5d8e19bab7d842a2ae6bb398f14ec",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6a6c908167a5ec377e0edc9eb8f570a6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一月的墨尔本，他离决赛只差一步。面对阿尔卡拉斯，他从两盘落后追到二比二，却还是输掉了第五盘。赛季的第一个大满贯，止步4强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3c070eccd58779a05b824bf1e67fa855005796491333e121f69934eacfaf38fa",
      "words_sha256": "8c33814df572650601082e6564eac54def2b46868bd20682c391f0b189b45b4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e9a09e40d9bba6dce3eee7f0757eef52ab70fffb6b4fbf44e5b22282c84d2daa",
      "request_id": "e9a09e40d9bba6dce3eee7f0757eef52ab70fffb6b4fbf44e5b22282c84d2daa",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "28eac1d1d9d04a72b81c2fbf7d5d6013",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "等了五个多月的赛季单打首冠，也是他生涯的第一座大满贯。这次，他终于把奖杯抱在了怀里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "468d043d197fba3978be125df701d1bcd942b821f21dcd7ca7c741c971d382b0",
      "words_sha256": "f828353e4c55d48d3871432588c37cd279205a614724e40b74037b2f668d653a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ee4e6d7e4a5077424069ebc9f10bc2642f460c9fb6a9617f5a85ea42ba035add",
      "request_id": "ee4e6d7e4a5077424069ebc9f10bc2642f460c9fb6a9617f5a85ea42ba035add",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "095e48fd6f6008eab4658c9d359924c4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从一冠难求，到两座大满贯和世界第一。到了都灵，兹维列夫还能继续突破吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8700ce18ede602ad2e4d90503aac45077ce9504ec6d12b33b79c628a95f867d1",
      "words_sha256": "30f63140765af20bffffe03c49d0612f12719bbfe5bfc4d051aedc05514a65a7"
    },
