    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "468d043d197fba3978be125df701d1bcd942b821f21dcd7ca7c741c971d382b0",
      "words_sha256": "f828353e4c55d48d3871432588c37cd279205a614724e40b74037b2f668d653a",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "28eac1d1d9d04a72b81c2fbf7d5d6013",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "等了五个多月的赛季单打首冠，也是他生涯的第一座大满贯。这次，他终于把奖杯抱在了怀里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "734c1da3dd4fea05588b80f326e210448f408e2520566d2c7a5a2a30d54d0aa8",
      "words_sha256": "12c919314216d90916640ea7baaa0d279e3a6ff18a2d7b6153147cc192d41584",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bb01b60f9972c1ba63d4935f78c385ec",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网，他又一次打进决赛。先赢一盘，辛纳却拿走了后面三盘。巴黎突破之后，草地上的这道关，他还是没能跨过去。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8ab5e154263d3bd6efa5a6621d3b3f6017eeea674095e2b1f41ef4a076f8c6c1",
      "words_sha256": "269c5e7d11f9ca4aa34d2170745a1b5cb02d7c456f143188053d7c800766fdc6",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3f3ae05a3be18b8def7e57d931fb6922",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "就在加拿大首战出局之后，八月六日，ATP正式宣布他入围年终总决赛。都灵门票到手，他的赛季还没有到最高点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "674bd90e6b7255bbc1dd855bd7551f4ebaf10416b6ecaae4a71fde5411403bd1",
      "words_sha256": "ff5174936341d48d7f52c03b86cc905541dff8b837a3cc0c29b703a3d6447d52",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0c85c50f93003ab95a77f7c751bb4cb8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "纽约，他连续第三项大满贯闯进决赛。面对谢尔顿，先拿两盘，再被追回一盘，最后以六比二收下第四盘。比赛结束，他竟然没发现自己已经赢了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d7c92cd6f64c4c52d1402ac868ad3e42d23c1e4a3ab5a17f9dc544a611279fa0",
      "words_sha256": "c07456448388448fd2da12ef93f7a38f108d99d3119f080a74f7684d9c09622c",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "48cf6319396009b576c17daaaee80f19",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六月之前，单打还没有冠军，九月已经握住两座大满贯。他今年的两座单打冠军，都来自大满贯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9054a1f72b809aa659983fb4842e5d679557b5aa674dc5110f2055ee68b13e60",
      "words_sha256": "06ab4eab222042419d61cf899d1d2e9cb77ef8977c0508a47433a6ef5e12a1f2",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c50ddeb1a065f2c958f93e3d41062cae",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月十二日，他提前锁定年终第一。但冠军之后，也会疲惫。他自己说，美网后总共只休息了一天。上海半决赛先赢一盘，还是被福基纳逆转。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ab38a4aa6edd4dcd549764a80ffb55c992f2e75e1d482b997a34c7b183444078",
      "words_sha256": "1692ed87f1adbfa051d9a702fd4a431109099530e4bd28155f3418c8964f4aa3",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7cdf77de1f45e1677c0666c22b8f1ff4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十一月二日，他第一次登上世界第一。提前锁定年终第一，到真正站上周榜榜首，这是两个不同的时刻。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "132ed2fa2baffe71055d6d08459696a8c955c509d31a03bcedf4a177ad2dccd4",
      "words_sha256": "1bf0dd6df91c31c6fccbd503f1250aa9da4109e5f1eb6e39f1de81c154313242",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e5df2ea23849564334e0b1678547336b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "维也纳止步4强之后，他来到巴黎，却以六比七、二比六输给穆塞蒂。世界第一的首战失利，下一站，是十一月十五日开始的都灵总决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8700ce18ede602ad2e4d90503aac45077ce9504ec6d12b33b79c628a95f867d1",
      "words_sha256": "30f63140765af20bffffe03c49d0612f12719bbfe5bfc4d051aedc05514a65a7",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "095e48fd6f6008eab4658c9d359924c4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从一冠难求，到两座大满贯和世界第一。到了都灵，兹维列夫还能继续突破吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8275849c575254a44195411df02957a99d1225bda9d2a1f19a367c1bb53844ee",
      "words_sha256": "9f7490bed83e7e7b77ec2198f84697771602bd544d313c0a0cb3c352bbd953c9",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
